================================================================================
                                 PRODUCT FEATURES
================================================================================

This professional library management system includes:

• Advanced Book Catalog Management
• Student & Staff Registration System
• Intelligent Borrowing & Return Tracking
• Automated Fine Calculation & Collection
• Barcode Scanning Integration
• Offline-First Operation with Cloud Sync
• Comprehensive Reporting & Analytics
• Multi-User Access Control
• Data Export & Backup Capabilities
• Professional Receipt & Report Generation

